{'symbol': 'AXP', 'date': '2023-05-01 15:32:00', 'title': 'AMERICAN EXPRESS VICE CHAIR DOUGLAS E. BUCKMINSTER TO PARTICIPATE IN SVB MOFFETTNATHANSON TECHNOLOGY, MEDIA, AND TELECOM CONFERENCE', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMERICAN EXPRESS COMPANY (NYSE: AXP) VICE CHAIR DOUGLAS E. BUCKMINSTER WILL PARTICIPATE IN THE SVB MOFFETTNATHANSON TECHNOLOGY, MEDIA, AND TELECOM CONFERENCE ON WEDNESDAY, MAY 17, AT 2 P.M. EASTERN. MR. BUCKMINSTER WILL PARTICIPATE IN A FIRESIDE CHAT RELATING TO THE COMPANY'S BUSINESS STRATEGY AND FINANCIAL PERFORMANCE. A LIVE AUDIO WEBCAST OF THE DISCUSSION WILL BE ACCESSIBLE TO THE GENERAL PUBLIC THROUGH THE AMERICAN EXPRESS INVESTOR RELATIONS WEBSITE AT HTTP://IR.A."}